  // archways
  "confession:archway-build-help-title": "How to build archways",
  "confession:archway-build-help-text": "Place the frame where you want to build the archway. Then add stones (1/3) and mortar (2/3) to build the basic framework. You can then finish the construction (3/3) with a fill block: rock, cobblestone, stone bricks, polished rock, dry stone, plaster, wattle and daub, fired or clinker bricks, brick courses, uneven bricks, rammed earth or mud bricks (also from supported mods). Rim stones and fill can be different materials. The tooltip will appear as soon as you hold a matching item in your hand.",
  "confession:window-build-help-title": "How to build",
  "confession:window-build-help-text": "The recipe determines the rim stones. Place the frame where you want to build the window block (1/2) and finish the construction (2/2) with a fill block: rock, cobblestone, stone bricks, polished rock, dry stone, plaster, wattle and daub, fired or clinker bricks, brick courses, uneven bricks, rammed earth or mud bricks (also from supported mods). Rim stones and fill can be different materials. The tooltip will appear as soon as you hold a matching block in your hand.",
  "confession:window-build-help-text2": "The recipe determines the material of the sill. Place the new block where you want to build the windowsill (1/2) and finish the construction (2/2) with a fill block: rock, cobblestone, stone bricks, polished rock, dry stone, plaster, wattle and daub, fired or clinker bricks, brick courses, uneven bricks, rammed earth or mud bricks (also from supported mods). The tooltip will appear as soon as you hold a matching block in your hand.",
